      "effects": [],
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Your shell is equipped with a realistic faux-skin casing and carefully sculpted to pass as a biomorph (perhaps even a particular person). The morph can cry, spit, have sex, and will even bleed if cut. Only a detailed physical examination at -30 or a radar or x-ray scan will detect the synthmorph&rsquo;s true nature. If disguised as a particular person, apply a +30 modifier to disguise-based Deceive or Exotic Skill: Disguise Tests.</p>",
